  "title": "Banana-Date Muffins",
  "description": "A tasty sweet muffin recipe that won&#39;t blow your diet. Bananas and dates team up with bran cereal for a tasty breakfast treat. You&#39;ll love it!",
  "authors": [
    "SHERRY SMITH"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:09:48-04:00",
